  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>A half-elven magic-user and thief with a longsword he was never strictly allowed to carry, a short fuse, and the restless energy of someone who has been sitting on the side of the table for forty years.</p><p><strong>Remnant.</strong> Max Hit Points, never rolled. It never attacks first. It cannot answer any question about its past that is not its Signature. It cannot leave a room by a door the party came through.</p>",
    "public": ""
   },
