     "recovery": [],
     "max": ""
    },
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>Rorvik always acts first, in every round, before anyone rolls initiative. Once per round his first Longsword attack hits without a roll, and a crackle of half-remembered magic runs down the blade: [[/damage 1d8+3 slashing]] plus [[/damage 3d6 force]]. He can then slip away up to his Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks: a thief's exit from a fight he started.</p>",
     "chat": ""
    },
    "identifier": "signature-hothead",
