     "spent": 0,
     "recovery": [],
     "max": ""
    },
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>In the Hoard, Rorvik is not there when the fight begins. At the top of round 2 the inner room's double doors bang open and he strides in, longsword out: 'Sorry I'm late. What did I miss?' From then on Hothead applies as normal: he acts first, every round, as if he had been there all along.</p>",
     "chat": ""
